      "body": "## Motivation\nMiniMax-M3 silently ignored enabled thinking and rejected disabled thinking on the Anthropic Messages endpoint.\nFixes #43146.\n\n## Modifications\nSet `thinking_mode` to `\"enabled\"` or `\"disabled\"` in `apply_reasoning_enabled`, matching the read path and preserving existing template kwargs.\n\nAdd a regression test covering both modes.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n- Regression fails before the fix and passes afterward.\n- All 156 serving-chat CPU unit tests pass.\n- Ruff, formatting, codespell, compilation, and `git diff --check` pass.\n\nModel accuracy evaluation was not run.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\nN/A. This change only maps a request option.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #37991988979](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37991988979)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #37991988692](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37991988692)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #37991988995](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37991988995)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
